4. DEVELOPER'S NOTE & COMMUNITY CONTRIBUTIONS
------------------------------------------------------------------------------
I built the Ananth E-Flash Engine with a relentless focus on extreme low-latency 
and lock-free performance. However, I do not claim this code to be 100% perfect. 
Real-world edge cases, extreme multi-threading race conditions, or architecture-
specific bugs may exist.

I invite the global C++ community, senior engineers, and systems researchers to 
freely tear this code apart, stress-test it, and point out my mistakes. Pull 
requests, bug reports, and architectural critiques are highly encouraged. By 
working together, we can build the ultimate memory allocator.

